<urn:atm:triage:finding/AXPE-QA-121>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AXPE-QA-121" ;
  triage:title "AW merge union pushes two atm-storage-rusqlite functions over the RULE-002 80-line hard limit" ;
  triage:description "On the Phase AW -> integrate/phase-ax merge branch, two functions in crates/atm-storage-rusqlite exceed the RULE-002 hard threshold (80 lines) and overlap the PR diff, so CI's Just lint fails and the merge gate cannot pass. reader_pool.rs submit_blocking_with_class_at is 80 lines at 11cb6e96c (75 lines on develop 7c2947279; the function does not exist on integrate/phase-ax 6e8f33ba5, the merge union of AX's reader-pool shutdown-guard changes and AW's version added five lines). writer/ops.rs execute is 81 lines (69 on develop, 77 on integrate/phase-ax; the union of AX's UpsertMessage { record, provenance } arms and AW's changes added the rest). Neither parent violates the rule on its own; the violation is merge integration fallout. Remediation: extract small private helpers so both functions are at most 70 production lines with no behavior change; verify with python3 scripts/check-function-length.py --base-ref origin/integrate/phase-ax and the crate's fmt/clippy/tests. QA-3 must run the full function-length check, not only lint_boundaries.py." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ax" ;
  triage:triageMode "ci_gate" ;
  triage:category "ci-lint-rule-002" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
